 para ti, mas não o suporto.","e":"I know he's important to you, but I can't stand that man.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.864176,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"8836c342e4dd27fdc3d5094dd0da7c4c","i":"6f041d80101df00919dd053a1e1c1f5e","r":"4247346:6291930:80:1156696","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4247346","6291930","80"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Eu suporto a dor até um limite muito alto.","e":"I have a high threshold for pain.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.663101,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"d4b76bd2f04bcda5d050304c577b33c1","i":"7fcfd7c6ccf284f2880ce6ee52704ebe","r":"6670618:6663306","c":"carlosalberto","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6670618","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6670618","b":"Tatoeba sentence #6670618 by carlosalberto; English translation #6663306 by CK","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6670618","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Eu não suporto a ideia de te perder para sempre.","e":"I can't stand the thought of losing you forever.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.907323,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"f9e4d80cc6b7b6f296e04300af83dca4","i":"a2905d2398a4cfdcef04487bedd7b559","r":"4840788:1954902","c":"KimiP","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4840788","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4840788","b":"Tatoeba sentence #4840788 by KimiP; English translation #1954902 by CK","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4840788","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Solta meu braço! Eu não suporto pessoas me tocando.","e":"Let go of my arm! I can't stand people touching me.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.866013,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"b63260af9b4733738158367dc9b9efa3","i":"1201e7fdd147da8eeb15b95d1affe0fb","r":"7560390:326610","c":"Ricardo14","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/7560390","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sent